# Component decomposition in the Thompson branch of 14.7.67

The local-family preparation establishes the genuine reduced witness,
faithful membership, 14.3.4(1–2) application, and exact kernel of the
original component action. The B.5.1 offender-group construction and the
14.3.4(3) constituent application remain separate prerequisites. Final
assembly here must construct SmallModuleDecomposition on that same action
and retain the stronger ambient complement C_E(BR₁).

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
14.7.67(4), printed p.1070, PDF p.1087.
